# ChirpParade preset
format = 1
name = Forest Morning
author = ChirpParade
description = A wood with a woodpecker in it. The drum sits 14 dB under the birds and arrives four times a minute, which is roughly what a walk through a wood in spring actually gives you, and the space is damped the way somewhere full of leaves is.
features = forest, ambience, drum, wide

